 "en-US-JennyNeural\u0000For guests who want to relax, the coast is the answer. Latakia has the finest beaches in the country, where the sea is warmer and the days are slower. And for families, a walk in a green garden or a visit to a busy, colourful souq is often more fun than a long museum tour.":{f:"22bfb28b698b56df",d:17.712,v:0.759,a:0.200,b:16.880,wd:[0.24, 0.44, 0.9, 1.15, 1.45, 1.64, 2.04, 2.32, 2.66, 2.84, 3.08, 3.56, 4.08, 4.24, 4.52, 5.0, 5.4, 5.56, 5.86, 6.4, 6.76, 7.01, 7.36, 7.38, 7.86, 8.1, 8.34, 8.64, 8.88, 9.37, 9.61, 9.88, 10.45, 10.57, 10.92, 11.06, 11.28, 11.52, 11.96, 12.24, 12.26, 12.63, 12.81, 12.93, 13.29, 14.0, 14.2, 14.4, 14.8, 15.05, 15.24, 15.59, 15.71, 16.01, 16.44],e:"000000PqYI0lydPLE0KLgNXaXGHHNPXSPYbYPKD00II0000EX00DbmUIG0QQH0UdSQQSNDGGVTLIE0000000000000000000000000Qta0MIijP00ncLVcJ0Rb000jhdbbQJE00SYS0LOZKIZQPQI00HXTLKETUQLG0000000jqNYXNOMeaedNI0EOWZWSTUUOGSSNVUEXYXXKNXOGOK0QZWWUUOLG0000000000000000000000000FsvV00nQ00nyonYVUQNNKINE00SlQNn-fG0XcdRE0PXbbZU0ZfcXMKNLK00MbegcIHbRKSfIGHQXUFKcYMKQXPID0000000DIvqgfI0QjLLNJjZD0LZLKEZbVG0TVTSSXfXF00OoaUPNJPURSRPUZZUUUSQOILWWRQOIEI0WVRNKG0000000000000000000000",w:"00-----KG3-Yfer-----P7DORB-+99KIDSacVOO---------cp--QNK---Zb--VlloiaOU--PJDD7Q-----0000000000000000---FUa---gbPf-ZczfY--SK---JQYAKx----IQN---R--OFASOx-zUP5--GIIKGW-----cLWNbh---lfZS---D6EHF9FIINRfI8XP5SibW--PE----IPLDDEGEADr------------------------hUP--KP--VdaPDIZlTTd-----QE66EOQc-VBKR8-BGIIB8xIQMPI8B8CLK9DGJIB-Wk--TE--EE92sWV---XNGA---------QIGK--YN----RTUx-W---ONL--QG88CCIK----RWZP75WWEMHBKPNKA6IPU--kheUA4---BHIGFAN-----0000000000000000",r:"--00000hly0TMNA00000cuodaq01sshjoZRPWdd000000000PC00beh000SQ00WGGDJRdX00ciooub00000--------------------------------"},
