 "en-US-JennyNeural\u0000We use COMPARATIVES to compare TWO things. For short adjectives, add -er and use than: old → older than, big → bigger than, cheap → cheaper than. For long adjectives (two syllables or more), use more … than: beautiful → more beautiful than, famous → more famous than. Example: Palmyra is older than the citadel. The Old City is more beautiful than the new town.":{f:"1af726f934669591",d:24.552,v:0.728,a:0.160,b:23.760,wd:[0.2, 0.39, 0.56, 1.56, 1.72, 2.28, 2.47, 2.99, 3.25, 3.64, 4.42, 4.76, 4.93, 5.19, 5.52, 5.88, 6.1, 6.23, 6.62, 6.92, 7.28, 7.3, 7.84, 8.32, 8.63, 8.76, 9.28, 9.67, 9.93, 10.25, 11.0, 11.29, 11.94, 12.13, 12.59, 12.85, 13.17, 13.36, 13.69, 14.34, 14.52, 14.8, 15.48, 15.83, 16.29, 16.48, 16.74, 17.19, 17.58, 18.08, 18.6, 18.88, 19.27, 19.59, 19.85, 20.44, 20.7, 20.96, 21.36, 21.38, 21.68, 22.44, 22.72, 23.03, 23.32],e:"-xxqL0NMlVZfXNNbLGUWUdSG0RXgPS00PUIRUQRUSSTP0M0KSQNLKJJG000000000000000000000",w:"00---8gxdfa----I89--UQSQUXSS---hf--B3--PPIh--NM--QnhdB32----------0000000000000000-----EK----GEL9YecXI-eWd-XWNG9-------fXXNPQOKVgQ4-bRM---UcXG8M+--DJHKPQQJHNJLN-ggbUL58X----nqT2SZoa-OQNfjeXUD49-----nZh----gHnKLS-ghZSK41E-------------------------IJMPPQRKGqheQ-saZ--TOK8---------ZX---XSGJ8gKK--LC966B9BEKKIHDR---Lnjb---BFACGKKIIBG-----vlejbWG7E---nmllUL--NGBDGEJG2BbaZsK--KLDZeeXQF36u-----lqbBJe---BDGI---bobCQl---VaSOG41K----------------------+slK--ZcJL-IDA85o------YLEGIQZTNVYPnX--oIGEMKMOehKEX---sSqSMWWPIDA8o----000000000---------+-hgSNHDB---SMUnjqaY--8EBE91KOQQuK--EDBbaBNW9QSLi--wgZPGB639V----0000000000000000",r:"--000tL4OMR0000jts00XbZbXUZZ000KM00qy00ccjK00ef00bEKOqyz0000000000-------------------------00000000010KLZekoq000ZfXEIBRT00tnqns+hdbb7h00noqQRqeVsbZgJ005LSclqvysW0000----------------"},
